<title>UK: Credit Local sets 100 million Ecu bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 100 million Ecu bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BIL and CCB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.75 PCT  MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.55    PAY DATE   S04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     SPREAD     +7 BP     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2002 AND 2004 OATS  NOTES	IPMA/ISDA ONE EURO FOR ONE ECU CLAUSE</p>
<p>		ISSUED UNDER AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
